@ Start

$ Background {&/Game/Melodia/UI/Textures/Figma/T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_SakuraDream.T_Melodia_Figma_Asset_Hero_SakuraDream} none 0

- Melusina
  Hold on—there's a melody slime right in the middle of the courtyard path. And it's pulsing in 4/4 time.

      $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_intro_greeting.mel_intro_greeting} 0.9

- Sir Melodious
  That is the First Resonance knot that sealed the house's opening chamber! Watch its lilac coat: every beat it tries to form a Chladni figure and drops the third bar.

- Melusina
  So if I tune it on the downbeat three times, the figure locks and we can resolve the phrase?

- Sir Melodious
  Precisely. Strike on the rising wave, lock the resonance figure, and bring the first measure home!

$ Notify melodia:battle:melodia_slime_tutorial

? if: {melodia_battle_result} == victory

  - .
    Pearl nodal curves flash across the slime's crest and dissolve into a warm, ringing C-major chord. Across the lawn, the first brass door of the Morning House unseals and rises over one bar of music.

        $ SFX {&/Game/Melodia/Audio/WaveHarp/SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4.SW_WaveHarp_Orchestra_C4} 0.85

  - Melusina
    The wave broke in our favor! And look—the first door of the house just opened.

        $ Voice {&/Game/Melodia/Characters/Melusina/Audio/mel_halfsong_02.mel_halfsong_02} 0.9

  $ melodia_slime_tutorial_resolved = on
  $ Notify melodia:quest:quest.slime_tutorial.first_tide
  $ Notify melodia:reward:reward.slime_tutorial.tidecall
  $ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.first_dream:flag.first_dream.quest.completed:reward.first_resonance_echo:intent.first_dream.complete:checkpoint.first_dream.complete
  $ Notify melodia:flag:flag.p0.playthrough.completed:true

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_battle_result} == defeat

    - Sir Melodious
      The tide pulled us off-tempo. Breathe, listen for the downbeat, and we shall catch the next wave.

    $ melodia_slime_tutorial_resolved = on
    $ Notify melodia:flag:flag.p0.playthrough.attempted:true

  ? else:

    ? if: {melodia_battle_result} == fled

      - Sir Melodious
        We stepped back in good time. The slime keeps its rhythm for our return.

      $ melodia_slime_tutorial_resolved = on
      $ Notify melodia:flag:flag.p0.playthrough.fled:true

    ? else:

      - Sir Melodious
        The battle could not begin. The dream remains open, waiting for a safer return.

    ? endif

  ? endif

? endif

@ Finish

? if: {melodia_slime_tutorial_resolved} == on

  $ Notify melodia:flag:flag.slime_tutorial.completed:true

  - .
    The first tide and the First Dream resolve together. Within the Morning House, the first story chamber stands open.

? else:

  - .
    The unfinished tide fades, leaving a path back to its first note.

? endif

$ End
